{"exps":[{"para":{"tag":"tag_1"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2"},"key":"top"},{"para":{"alpha":0,"scaleX":1.5,"trans":true,"layer":"bg","noOut":false,"noIn":false,"bright":1,"scaleY":1.5,"x":-500,"mirrow":false,"y":-125,"img":"bgblack","addImg":""},"key":"setLayer"},{"para":{"alpha":0.4,"scaleX":1.5,"trans":true,"layer":"bg","noOut":false,"noIn":false,"bright":1,"transTime":300,"scaleY":1.5,"x":-500,"mirrow":false,"y":-125,"img":"bgblack","addImg":""},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_2"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"alpha":0,"scaleX":1,"trans":true,"layer":"chara2","noOut":false,"noIn":false,"bright":1,"scaleY":1,"x":220,"mirrow":false,"y":-154,"img":"chara045_1","addImg":"chara045_1_face_chara045_1c"},"key":"setLayer"},{"para":{"alpha":1,"scaleX":1,"trans":true,"layer":"chara2","noOut":false,"noIn":false,"bright":1,"transTime":300,"scaleY":1,"x":220,"mirrow":false,"y":-154,"img":"chara045_1","addImg":"chara045_1_face_chara045_1c"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"艾尔菲帕","text":"[show]嗯～？问我一直光着脚，走路不会痛吗？[r]唔，穿鞋子太拘束了，我更喜欢赤着脚接触大自然。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_3"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2","img":"chara045_1_face_chara045_1b"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"艾尔菲帕","text":"[show]而且，我的双脚也被雷电所保护，即便是尖锐的石子也没法捅穿。[r]虽然罩着这么一层力场，但踩在地上的感觉，其实和普通赤脚没什么两样。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_4"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2","img":"chara045_1_face_chara045_1a"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"艾尔菲帕","text":"[show]最重要的是……要是我不这样直接接触地面的话，可能光是我们现在这样的距离，之间就会迸发足以撕裂空气的雷电哦。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_5"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2","img":"chara045_1_face_chara045_1b"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"艾尔菲帕","text":"[show]换句话说，要是我双脚离地了，说不定就会有人倒霉了呢。这下明白了嘛？[l][cm]"},"key":"text"}],"des":"艾尔菲帕-熟识2","script":"yd_045_05"}